Third-party material in the baud-wayland crate

The licence of baud-wayland is LICENSE. This file lists the material from
other projects that files in this crate carry: for each, the files by their
paths in this crate, the licence it keeps, and where the notice that licence
asks for is. It is generated from docs/research/third-party.toml in baud's
repository, whose THIRD_PARTY.md lists every such file in the repository.

baud-wayland's build reads the Wayland and wayland-protocols XMLs into its
interface tables, through links in baud-wayland/protocols/ to the copies in
docs/research/sources/, which the published crate carries as the files
  Files:   protocols/wayland.xml, protocols/wp-commit-timing-v1.xml,
           protocols/wp-cursor-shape-v1.xml, protocols/wp-fifo-v1.xml,
           protocols/wp-fractional-scale-v1.xml,
           protocols/wp-linux-dmabuf-v1.xml,
           protocols/wp-linux-drm-syncobj-v1.xml,
           protocols/wp-presentation-time.xml,
           protocols/wp-primary-selection-unstable-v1.xml,
           protocols/wp-tearing-control-v1.xml, protocols/wp-viewporter.xml,
           protocols/wp-xdg-decoration-unstable-v1.xml,
           protocols/wp-xdg-shell.xml, protocols/xdg-activation-v1.xml,
           protocols/xdg-system-bell-v1.xml
